<title>INDIA: India clears Cadbury Schweppes Beverages proposal.</title>
<headline>India clears Cadbury Schweppes Beverages proposal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian Industry Ministry said on Thursday it cleared a $15 million investment by Cadbury Schweppes Beverages India Pvt Ltd to set a wholly-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>The ministry said in a statement that the company would set up a fruit-based beverages and other non-cola drinks unit in Bombay.</p>
<p>It did not give any other details.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301-2024</p>
</text>
